    "sodium thiosulfate (reduced-sulfur source)",
    "p-aminobenzoic acid (PABA vitamin)",
    "N2 anoxic gas phase"
   ],
   "corrections": [],
   "notes": "MDC80 is exactly MDC plus 80 mM NaCl (for Vibrio natriegens' halophilic salt requirement). Same recovered additions as MDC: molybdate and borate (from the Kremer 2015 trace solution) plus thiosulfate, PABA vitamin, and the N2 gas phase were absent from the current model list. The extra NaCl adds substantial Na+/Cl- beyond the already-present Na and Cl exchanges. Trace-metal final concentrations are very low (0.1% v/v solution, with 'Metals 44' a further 0.1% v/v); stock concentrations reported, conc_mM left null."
  },
